{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちぴょん(´・x・*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後です＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山のコメントありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"陽菜の支えになってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/06/2845644/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/06/2845644/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/06/2845644/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑コメントが嬉しすぎて何も言えない表情です(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"***"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またも、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーのブログに登場した(/´△`＼)照"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみんがね、妹にするなら川後だって"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/06/2845644/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しい嬉しい////"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大人びてるメンバーも川後らしい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近よく色んな人に「大人！」って言われるんだ(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見た目は大人、頭脳は子供 (`・ω・)←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみんも書いてたけどね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前、2人で4時間くらいお話したんだよ。\nいいでしょっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/06/2845644/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみん大好き(*´ー｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"べびたん(まりか)がね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"デートしよーっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"て誘ってくれたんだ*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな優しいメンバーです(;つД｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"***"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"渋谷に行ったんだ♪。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1人で。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後は、1人でどこまでもいける"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気がする。(笑) 気がする。(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"映画とかも1人でいっちゃうよ(´-ω-`)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/06/2845644/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んとー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ロフトと109をみたよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ロフトはね、めっちゃ好きなの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長崎にいた頃は、福岡の天神にあるロフトによくいってた(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の購入品は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無いです(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見るだけです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タピオカは飲んだよ＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"***"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日から、『劇場版 魔法少女まどか☆マギカ』公開"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/06/2845644/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見に行きたい(/´△`＼)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん一緒に行ってくれるって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少し前のブログで言ってくれたので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行きましょっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/06/2845644/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/06/2845644/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"劇場版 まどマギの予告みたんですよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたらね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さやかちゃんに髪飾りが付いてたんですよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛すぎませんか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/06/2845644/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"萌"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見に行きたいー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ。でもね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『新しい靴を買わなくちゃ』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"も見たいんですよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"桐谷美玲さんが出てるんだもんっっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/06/2845644/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よしっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえず本屋いきます←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえず映画館いきます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"***"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お部屋紹介の続き(´-ω-`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お部屋?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/06/2845644/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"洋服をラックにかけてるよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ以外の服はクローゼットに直してます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"基本、LIZLISA をかけてるかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"左にあるのは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"桐谷美玲さんのカレンダー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/06/2845644/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また、お部屋を紹介します(*´ー｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰が片付けたの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って質問あったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろん川後ですよっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/06/2845644/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/06/2845644/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京来て、約1年たって落ち着きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よかったよかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"***"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆるーく質問返し(*´ω｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎魔法で俺の部屋もきれいにしてくれるかな？\n└じゃあいっくよー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/06/2845644/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ピーリカピリララ ポポリナペーペルト (c)\nお部屋よきれいになーれっ☆kr"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これでキレイになったはず！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎トルコアイスって何年か前にカップアイスがありましたよね？\n└陽菜は知らなかったんだけど、\n「かずみんがコンビニとかで普通に売ってたんだよっ」\nって言ってました(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎握手の時は方言の方がいいかな？\n└自然体でいいよ♪。普段通りでっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/06/2845644/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎戦隊モノのおもちゃ持っとったと？\n└持ってた！へんしーんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎一番大切にしてる物は何？\n└全部ー♪(笑)どれも大切なので選べません"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/06/2845644/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎天ぷらにケチャップとマヨネーズ合うの？\n└騙されたと思ってやってみて！(笑)\n美味しいよー！素材の味が分かんなくなるかもだけど"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/06/2845644/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎寝たらあかんけど眠たいときどーやって乗りきりますか？\n└これは振りですか？(笑)\nそりゃあ、メガシャキ飲むしかー！\nいい質問ありがとう(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎ひなめろっていうのはひなぴょんのファンってことでいいのかな？\n└うん！そうだよー！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/06/2845644/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろん、1推しじゃなくても陽菜の事を応援してくれてる人みんな＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終わりっっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気になった質問かえしてみました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/06/2845644/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(107のブログ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまーにやってみよっかな(о´ー`о)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"***"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/06/2845644/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10月といえば？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/06/2845644/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"***"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それじゃあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みーんなの心に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"魔法をかけちゃうぞ？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/06/2845644/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいぴょん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメント待ってるね(。・ω・。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"http